<title>USA: Downey sets 5 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>Downey sets 5 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Downey Financial Corp said Wednesday its board of directors approved a 5 percent stock dividend in addition to its regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable on both existing shares outstanding as well as those to be issued as a result of the stock dividend, thereby effectively providing shareholders with a 5 percent cash dividend increase.</p>
<p>Both the stock and cash dividend will be payable on May 22, to shareholders of record on May 8. After the stock dividend there will be about 26.7 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
